  "generated_text": "1. Cross-multiply to eliminate the fractions:\n\\[\n(r+9)(r+5) = (r-2)(r-3)\n\\]\n\n2. Expand both sides:\n\\[\nr^2 + 5r + 9r + 45 = r^2 - 3r - 2r + 6\n\\]\n\n3. Simplify both sides:\n\\[\nr^2 + 14r + 45 = r^2 - 5r + 6\n\\]\n\n4. Subtract \\(r^2\\) from both sides:\n\\[\n14r + 45 = -5r + 6\n\\]\n\n5. Add \\(5r\\) to both sides:\n\\[\n19r + 45 = 6\n\\]\n\n6. Subtract 45 from both sides:\n\\[\n19r = -39\n\\]\n\n7. Divide both sides by 19:\n\\[\nr = -\\frac{39}{19}\n\\]\n\nSo, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{-\\frac{39}{19}}\n\\]",
